# Standing, walking and sprinting on a floor of server objects (sampcov.pwn commands, one per line; `sleep|S` waits,
# `shot|NAME` takes a screenshot), high above Grove Street so that only the objects carry the player: SA:MP's 10 m
# wall panels 19377 and 19379 and the 10 x 5 m concrete slab 18766 laid flat, and the stock platform 3095; then the
# street, for reference. On each the player stands still, walks 2 s, and from the same spot sprints 0.8 s, both with
# an animation that moves it and that the server clears on a timer; `track|250` logs the server's view of the player's
# position four times a second. A player standing still must not drift, and one that stops must stop on the objects
# as it does on the street. Run after the spawn by samp-rs-ab.sh (CMDS=...) on the DLL client and by mod-join.sh
# (CMDS=...) on the samp mod, which needs SA:MP's data files in its folder; tools/e2e/samp/floor-drift.py tabulates
# the server logs, and with --frames the mod's frame-by-frame view (its regression check: on the objects the move
# speed changes as fast as on the street):
#   SA_GAME_DUMP='B7CD98>14>30:c,B7CD98>44:c,B7CD98>568:4,B7CB5C:4' FRAMES=12000 SA_GAME_WALK=0:0 \
#     CMDS=tools/e2e/samp/floor.cmds tools/e2e/samp/mod-join.sh OUT
#   tools/e2e/samp/floor-drift.py --frames --min-change 0.015 OUT/sa-game.log
clearnpcs
clearvehs
